Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had good times and bad times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My childhood wasn't very traumatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not problem-free either, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes my parents punished me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They were strict, but fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was good I learned to tell good from evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A normal upbringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'd like to talk more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're getting nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because I have no real problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Except sometimes I don't know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like sleepwalking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I contacted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not remembering everything.
